From Coca-Cola bottling to mixed-use development, Hub City Bottleworks is proof that great sites can have more than one chapter!

Completed in 2025, the former Highway 29 bottling facility was redeveloped into a destination for retail, restaurants, office space, and entertainment.

SW+ was part of the team behind Phase 1 of the redevelopment, providing civil engineering services that helped bring the vision to reality.

