Inspiring the next generation of landscape architects 🌿

We were excited to welcome Clemson University's Summer Scholars back to our Greenville office for the third consecutive year!

We gave students an inside look at what we do, sharing how projects come to life, what the design process looks like, and what a career in landscape architecture can look like. The visit wrapped up with a tour of Judson Mill, where they got to see one of our projects firsthand!

